---
title: "Mere Sang"
artist: "Bollywood"
key: "C"
tags: ["hindi"]
---

{c: Verse}

[C]mere sang toh chal [Dm]zara, [F]kyun deekhe dara [C]dara

[Am]mere sang toh chal [Dm]zara, [F]kyun deekhe dara [C]dara

[C]chal tujhko aa chhu [F]pa lu, [Dm7]apni main baahon [Em]mein

[Am]chal khwaab kuch sa [F]jaa du, [Dm7]teri inn nigaahon [G]mein

{c: Chorus}

[G]main jo [CM7]sang [C]hu, tere [CM7]rang [C]hu, raahon se [FM7]teri chun lu main [Em]khwaab..

..har [Am]lamha yun [F]gujre, ke geh [Em]aata [Dm]jaye [C]pyaar..[G]

mere sang...

{c: Bridge}

[C]hans de zara sa tu, [Em]teri hasi se [F]mere kal ho [C]haseen

[C]bas itna chahu main [Gm]iss zindagi se [F]zyada kuch [C]nahi..[G]

chords used(play exact as mentioned):

(Dm7-xx0211)

(CM7-x32000)
